<title>NETHERLANDS: BREEVAST POSTS HIGHER H1 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>BREEVAST POSTS HIGHER H1 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.78 vs   0.75</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.7  vs   5.3</p>
<p>    Total income			  27.4  vs  23.9</p>
<p>    Operating costs		     21.7  vs  15.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.7  vs   8.0</p>
<p>    Income from associates	     0.9  vs   0.2</p>
<p>    Financial charges		    0.9  vs   3.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Property development company Breevast NV said in</p>
<p>March it expected profit growth in 1996.</p>
</text>
